  {
   "id": "horatio-goes-snowboarding-150465@major-2021-08-19",
   "gameId": "horatio-goes-snowboarding-150465",
   "displayName": "The Skiers Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-08-19T06:46:02.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We've just brought a huge addition to Horatio Goes Snowboarding.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "What's a ski-slope with no skiers? NOTHING! That's what. So we've put Skiers into the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "These hapless little dudes slowly start to appear on the slopes in greater numbers as the days go by. Sometimes on their own, sometimes in long trains.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now, in normal games you'd be avoiding these harmless chaps, minding their own business, not bothering anyone. Not in Horatio Goes Snowboarding! Horatio HATES skiers and loves to bowl into them, sending them flying. Give it a go!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "They give you MASSIVE points, so it can be a tough choice to make sometimes, take out a skier or stick to the gates. And wait till the yeti gets involved in the equation, that's when things really get spicy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Anyway, we hope you enjoy this update! It's a bit of a game changer and amplifies the fun quite a bit, so do give it a go and let us know how you get on.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Team ISG",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
