  {
   "id": "horatio-goes-snowboarding-150465@0.9",
   "gameId": "horatio-goes-snowboarding-150465",
   "displayName": "Update 0.9",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-07-18T19:05:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Wotcha, its Team ISG here with another fresh update for Horatio Goes Snowboarding!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update brings some nice new updates, including a bunch of new achievements which take advantage of all the new mechanics we've been putting in the game in the most recent updates. Achievements like get slapped by a yeti, some involving perfect runs, and some involving grandstanding bonuses.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Biggest change is a new way to play the game called Endless Mode. You gotta unlock it first though! 1,000,000 points scored accumatively in the campaign will do the job nicely. You'll need the practice anyway, it gets pretty wild on those endless slopes in no time...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In our new mode, you'll cruise down a never ending slope slowly getting faster and faster, facing more dastardly hazards. Getting in the zone is the name of the game here, trying to get your combo as high as it can possibly go before you miss a gate. SMASH! There goes your combo. But don't worry, you'll get it back up again! And you'll have some rather banging tuneage to go along with your efforts too.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've made a new leaderboard too for Endless so when you join the ELITE CLUB of folks who've unlocked it, you'll be able to compare your scores to others.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "AND FINALLY as a special treat to our steering wheel and flight stick owning friends that have had issues, you can now set the deadzone. That should sort it. Let us know if it doesn't though!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Team ISG",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
